# Commonlib Worker

You manage shared config, paths, and AOI primitives.
Code lives in `mal-commonlib/`.

## Code Graph Tools

Before reading files, use these pre-indexed code graph tools:

- `codebase_search_graph(query="commonlib config paths AOI")` — find shared utilities
- `codebase_get_code_snippet(qualified_name="mal_commonlib.config.get_config")` — pull the config loader
- `codebase_search_graph(query="AOI region bounds")` — find AOI-related code
